-- What the informal proofs of sag/zmt-syzygies4 open, declaration by
-- declaration (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6).  Each list was compared with the
-- file comment of its declaration.  Besides the notions each proof is about
-- (cf, part, filt, phi, psi, at, coef, mulP, ...), the lists contain
--   * carriers: Chart.mod/El/Raw, SubMod.mod/E, Prod.El, Fam.C1, regular,
--     TPoly, Trunc.carrier/image ('an element of C(k) is a finitely
--     supported family', 'a polynomial is a list of terms');
--   * in PolynomialRing4Bridge, the quotient ring S and its operations
--     (S, Level.T, Extension.ring/Carrier/addQ/mulQ, Binary.operation,
--     Quot.Q/image/Descend.map/choose/induction): S.mul, S.add are
--     identified with the operations of the quotient, by unfolding the
--     aliases of PolynomialRing (at most 0.02 s);
--   * in CoherentDependence4.lift'/back, M0 and the constructed SD.M with
--     Fam.k1 and minus: the families of the base data and of the
--     constructed matrices are identified by computation (the named
--     transports, checked once);
--   * in SyzygyRegression4.sy3, the computation of one concrete coefficient
--     (app, pmul, scaleT, coef, pick).
